---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | The English Hacker"
  description="Terms of service for TheEnglishHacker.com"
>
  <header class="border-b border-hacker-border px-6 py-4">
    <a href="/" class="text-hacker-green font-bold text-sm">&gt;_ TheEnglishHacker</a>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-hacker-dim">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs text-hacker-dim mb-2">// LEGAL</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-hacker-text">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs mt-2">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">1. Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By using TheEnglishHacker.com, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">2. Service description</h2>
      <p>The English Hacker provides Cambridge English exam practice exercises for educational purposes. We are not affiliated with or endorsed by Cambridge Assessment English.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">3. Payments and refunds</h2>
      <p>All payments are processed by Stripe. Prices are displayed in euros (EUR). We offer a 14-day money-back guarantee: if you are not satisfied, contact us within 14 days of purchase for a full refund, no questions asked.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">4. Access and content</h2>
      <p>Upon purchase, access is granted via your browser's localStorage. This access is tied to a single browser and device. We are not responsible for loss of access due to clearing browser data. We reserve the right to add, modify, or remove content.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All exercise content, design, and code on this site is the intellectual property of TheEnglishHacker.com unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce or distribute content without permission.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The English Hacker is provided "as is". We make no guarantees about exam results. Use of this platform does not guarantee passing any Cambridge English examination.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-hacker-text font-bold">7. Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@theenglishhacker.com" class="text-hacker-green hover:underline">hello@theenglishhacker.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
